  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The slope of a line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;hence the slope of the given line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Also, we know that the slope of tangent to a curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> at a point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></msub></math></p><p>We have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Applying quotient rule for differentiation, i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Also, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
